# Internal design docs stay out of the public repository -- the same rule
# pokebag-plus adopted in 6c5a300. They are already excluded from the mod
# archive by .modkitignore; this keeps them out of the repo as well.
docs/*
# ...except the published style guide, which is meant to be read here
!docs/changelog-style.md

# Authoring-tool scratch, untracked but easy to commit by accident
.superpowers/
